:null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Midori is a house ghost that has lived in the Itsukaichi household for as long as Keiji can remember. She was Keiji's best friend and always used to play with him around the house."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Being a zashikiwarashi. Midori has a somewhat childish mentality and acts on impulse instead of thinking things through. As such, an argument between her and Keiji breaks out when Midori (out of jealousy) releases a stag beetle that Keiji had captured, feeling that what he was doing got in the way of playing games with her. The argument ends with Keiji telling her that he'd be fine with her leaving, and she decides to do so."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With almost ten years having passed since that day, Midori decides to give herself a second chance with Keiji. Aware that he might not forgive her for leaving the house (she particularly blames herself for the death of Keiji's parents), she decides to remake herself into something else. The result are two youkai. A kage-onna named Mikage, and a yakubyougami named Sachiko. Another way to put it is that Midori became Mikage, and what was left over turned into Sachiko."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21938"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"座敷童。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて主人公の家に住み着いていたが、ひょんなことから主人公と喧嘩をして、出て行ってしまった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18177","sourceWorkId":"10855","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"座敷童。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて主人公の家に住み着いていたが、ひょんなことから主人公と喧嘩をして、出て行ってしまった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"187555"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76fe57e9f8cbc7410f2de92a8be7109a21a015f918e86ea39a699563bf47116b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70fb223972ac37b02c277a1185824879b80298f115bb88bfe8a9fdbf2e2323ba.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"結下みちる","creatorId":"vndb:s794","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s794","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s794","name":"結下 みちる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13251:187555:4705:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21939","characterName":"鈴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["18176"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21939"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"鈴彦姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"藤花の祀られている神社の鈴が変化した付喪神であり、藤花の眷属となった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18176","sourceWorkId":"10855","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ceec5c9e1a4e5cd08b8c69b7736c95c61edb000f9a7dd47b9587fa5cf91fc16c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75a78b46acaca1b0851b34de69394754fe0ae8c4cd98168da10536c7cc65a4c3.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c955","characterName":"美影","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54724","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"13251"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18168"],"vndbCharacterId":"c955"},"originalCharacterName":"美影","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mikage is introduced at the beginning of the story, waking our protagonist up in the morning and informing that she is bound to him and his house. This, in effect, means that no matter how much Keiji would want her to leave, she would not be able to do so for as long as our protagonist lived. She seems to be focused on ensuring that Keiji is happy, and at times has to act as the keeper of order in the house. Mikage is for the most part docile and willing to go along with Keiji, though there are certain moments where she has to put her foot down or take action against anything that might cause harm to the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c955"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一人暮らしの主人公の家に住み着いた押しかけ女房。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"追い出そうとする圭治の仕打ちにもめげず、必死で尽くす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物腰は丁寧で柔らかいが、主人公のためになるならば、強い主張を通すことも辞さない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふ、今日の夕ご飯は、圭治さんの好きな麻婆豆腐ですよ」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18168","sourceWorkId":"10855","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一人暮らしの主人公の家に住み着いた押しかけ女房。追い出そうとする主人公の仕打ちにもめげず、必死で尽くす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物腰は丁寧で柔らかいが、主人公のためになるならば、強い主張を通すことも辞さない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お昼、一緒に食べるって、言ったじゃないですか……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54724"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18168","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"163 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18168","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18168","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18168","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a2803b9543073cd91079f089b5c859a278b566023c5a67d5725995cf16dbadb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/05b6d7be4f2b96b8fca274f026f6b5249f1cfb19c1d9f72dd10f369b392c2f14.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"結下みちる","creatorId":"vndb:s794","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s794","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s794","name":"結下 みちる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13251:54724:4705:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c956","characterName":"幸子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54725","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"13251"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18169"],"vndbCharacterId":"c956"},"originalCharacterName":"幸子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"73"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"72"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sachiko is introduced when Keiji and Mikage discover that the noises coming from the attic of the Itsukaichi home are actually her sneaking around. After a quick introduction, Sachiko reveals that she has been living in Keiji's house for the last six months, and claims to have been summoned by our protagonist's bitterness and pessimism."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite being a yakubyougami (god of pestilence), Sachiko's power seems to be tied directly to the way our protagonist feels. This means that while our protagonist being content and happy weakens her, she becomes stronger when Keiji is angry or feeling any negative emotions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sachiko is cheeky and quick-witted, but prefers to stay in the background to point and laugh at our protagonist and Mikage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c956"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"座敷童と入れ替わるようにして、ひっそりと住み着いていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"発見されてからは開き直って、家の中を我が物顔で歩き回るようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天の邪鬼だが根は悪くない性格で、まるで気の強い妹のような感じ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あたしは疫病神だから、ろくでもないのは当たり前さ、きゃはっ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18169","sourceWorkId":"10855","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"座敷童と入れ替わるようにして、ひっそりと住み着いていた。発見されてからは開き直って、家の中を我が物顔で歩き回るようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天の邪鬼だが、根は悪くない性格で、まるで気の強い妹のようにも感じられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふんがー！　疫病神をこき使う家なんて初めてさ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54725"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"73 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18169","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"152 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18169","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"72 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18169","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18169","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23f24fd49457a3784a6d45e7eccf9b6967b84651ef69661181bb9be5d52c7d1b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f38a03616de676c8f308f523e8fa54da3b8f33e4123b66c0f36a1c15b1b8a12.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"いのくちゆか","creatorId":"vndb:s590","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s590","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s590","name":"いのくち ゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13251:54725:4490:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c957","characterName":"イソラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54729","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"13251"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18173"],"vndbCharacterId":"c957"},"originalCharacterName":"イソラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"72"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"72"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Isora is a kappa that lives in the Motoki River, north of Tokieda's residential area. As a child, Keiji spent a lot of time playing with Isora and developed a sort of friendship with the kappa. With ten years having passed since her days of playing in the river with Keiji, Isora is looking to pick up where they left off. To her surprise, Keiji being older means his interests are elsewhere now."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As the osananajimi character, she has had a thing for Keiji since he was a child, and can be notably jealous when she sees our protagonist around other girls."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c957"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"圭治の幼馴染み。河童に性はないのだが、男児に変化して主人公と遊んでいた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成長するにつれて、圭治が遊びに来なくなりとても寂しがっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"久しぶりに会うようになった圭治の気を、美少女に変化して引こうとしたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「遠慮しなくていいぞ！　裸の付き合いをしようじゃないか！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18173","sourceWorkId":"10855","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の幼馴染み。河童に性はないのだが、男児に変化して主人公と遊んでいた。成長するにつれて主人公が遊びに来なくなってから、とても寂しがっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"久しぶりに会うようになった主人公に対して、美少女に変化して気を引こうとしたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「遠慮しなくていいぞ！　裸の付き合いをしようじゃないか！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54729"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"72 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18173","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"150 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18173","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"72 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18173","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18173","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c31b419b06b05c58f2df93f9aeb000daa28bef915ba3309936f17655d2d21b8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/791b8ce6600e26debe6847f2a561f0d5a82f6a60ab36180cefebdfae4d08363a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中川里江","creatorId":"vndb:s3204","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3204","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3204","name":"中川 里江","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13251:54729:10708:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c958","characterName":"藤花","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54726","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"13251"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18170"],"vndbCharacterId":"c958"},"originalCharacterName":"藤花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Our protagonist first meets Touka while using the hot springs that are adjacent to the seemingly-abandoned Fujiyu Shrine. Touka has actually been a resident of the shrine for several centuries, but has made little to no effort to venture beyond the shrine itself. Her servant (a youkai rabbit named Suzuhikohime) secretly thinks of Touka as a hikikomori due to her never leaving the shrine."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c958"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて「妲妃」や「玉藻前」として恐れられた大妖怪……らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、退治されたトラウマのため、男をたぶらかして何事かをするなど、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いまでは考えるだけで恐ろしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お主、わらわの身体を見てどう思う？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18170","sourceWorkId":"10855","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"正体は殺生石という石で、主人公の住む町の神社に祀られていた欠片が、変化（復活）したもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて妲妃や玉藻前などとして恐れられた大妖怪らしい。しかし、退治されたトラウマのため、男をたぶらかして何事かをするなど、いまでは考えるだけで恐ろしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「しかしいまはのう……ほかにすることもないのでな、温泉三昧じゃ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54726"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18170","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"166 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18170","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18170","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18170","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/865548c87ae60ed4523950a8e35c3481f803892e52d2e6039d3a81be1313149e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b55f19cfe6e319f480a942af1a0db44c7342379bd364761ba5c164691dae5197.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13251:54726:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c959","characterName":"千鶴美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54730","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"13251"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18174"],"vndbCharacterId":"c959"},"originalCharacterName":"千鶴美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"69"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"146"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"71"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl that randomly appears behind our protagonist and glomps or tackles him. Keiji claims to not know her, but she seems to suggest otherwise."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Given her cheerfulness and playful demeanor, Chizumi is very gullible and will listen to Keiji's orders and follow them to the dot."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c959"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"町中で圭治につきまとってくる謎の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"舌ったらずで、自分のことを「ちぢゅみ」と呼び、なぜかいつも腹をすかせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"邪険にしても怒らず、めげず、愛嬌があり、そしてしつこい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公におやつをたかるかと思えば、縁起物を拾ってきてくれたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「おにぎり！　おむすび！　ころりん！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18174","sourceWorkId":"10855","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"町中で主人公につきまとってくる謎の女の子。主人公は、彼女が妖怪であるということだけは察知する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"舌ったらずで、自分のことを「ちぢゅみ」と言う。いつも腹をすかせている。しつこいが、邪険にしても怒らず、めげず、愛嬌がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公におやつをたかるかと思えば、縁起物を拾ってきてくれたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ちぢゅみ英語わかるよ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54730"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"69 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18174","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"146 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18174","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"71 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18174","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18174","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb08a22811fa5bae21d2644b89ffb4bb35003a23b4f122496374e94a16617f44.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc4f7525c27a205b636e5f7e3b09fe6716d420a9c11a6b1bd3a3b3215ab27fb8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梶田夕貴","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13251:54730:6106:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c960","characterName":"瀬織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54728","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"13251"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18172"],"vndbCharacterId":"c960"},"originalCharacterName":"瀬織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Seori is a hashihime (bridge princess) that has been around for a very long time. She claims to have lost track of how long exactly, which leads to her to say \"somewhere between 2000 and 3000 years\" when talking about her age. Keiji at first refers to her as a homeless person, seeing that she lives in a tent under the bridge that is her haunt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Often seen as the older sister of the group, Seori's primary focus seems to be her distaste for affection and love between couples. Despite her purpose as a hashihime, she's actually good-humored and has a tendency to be playful. Her interest in Keiji stems from the fact that he is a human that can see her and talk to her on a normal level. The fact that she is lonely and bored is also something that helps her sympathize with Keiji."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c960"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近、圭治の家の近所にある「篠橋」のたもとに住み着いた妖怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カップルが嫌いで、橋を渡るカップルを別れさせており、それ以来「篠橋」には「別れ橋」という俗称が付いた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"数千年前からそうしているらしく、あちこちの橋を転々としてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ああ、桜ね、なぜか私が住み着くと枯れる」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18172","sourceWorkId":"10855","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近、主人公の家の近所にある篠橋という橋のたもとに住み着いた。それ以来篠橋には、カップルで渡ると別れる羽目になるという噂が立ち、「別れ橋」という俗称が付いた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ああ、桜ね、なぜか私が住み着くと枯れる」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54728"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18172","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"165 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18172","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18172","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18172","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca8a7291d84d28d6cbeb1f95636b0d315848254f9439fbf692b5f58cbf646c5d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/24b67ae61847fd211ad1f806baec0905fcd049a472859a5f2ba7a5369b8c185d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"浅井 晴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13251:54728:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c961","characterName":"白沢佐久夜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54727","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"13251"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18171"],"vndbCharacterId":"c961"},"originalCharacterName":"白沢佐久夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"94"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sakuya is introduced to our protagonist as a girl that is looking after the Shirasawa convenience store in the residential area. She eventually reveals herself to be a hakutaku, and proves to be powerful enough to make herself corporeal (unlike other youkai, who can only be seen by Keiji). As a hakutaku, Sakuya has the ability to make predictions and is quite knowledgeable overall."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c961"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"あらゆる知識を持つという白澤らしいが、白澤にしてはあまりに頭が悪い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"牛の妖怪であることは確からしく、小さな角があり、加えて巨乳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ふつうの人間にも見える妖怪で、人間社会で商店を経営、店に来る子どもたちから人気があり、彼女も子どもたちを愛している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「もうっ！　その呼び方はやめてって言ったでしょう」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18171","sourceWorkId":"10855","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"あらゆる知識を持つという白澤らしいが、白澤にしてはあまりに頭が悪い。牛の妖怪であることは確からしく、小さな角があり、巨乳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ふつうの人間にも見える妖怪変化であり、角は帽子で隠して、人間社会で個人商店を経営している。店に来る子どもたちからは人気があり、彼女も子どもたちを愛している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「わ、わたし、ホルスタインじゃありませんっ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54727"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"94 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18171","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"167 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18171","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18171","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18171","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/abf5b2982f8a5080a4de30662acbf38c0380b05120dbbe1b56295069918b0bbc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/ac3e948f15a0a1c5569223c885d5881ca85fb6afd6063798ee922e1ab5ab1d0b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"やなせなつみ","creatorId":"vndb:s365","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s365","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s365","name":"やなせ なつみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13251:54727:4714:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c962","characterName":"瑞原穂波","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54731","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"13251"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18175"],"vndbCharacterId":"c962"},"originalCharacterName":"瑞原穂波","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Honami is a girl that attends Tokieda Academy and is president of the Society for the Study of Youkai / Local History Research Club. The former is the real intention of her club (as she has a thing for the occult), while the latter is the official name of the club for purposes of having it registered at school. She eventually manages to convince Keiji to join, and is specially drawn to our protagonist's ability to see and interact with youkai."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As part of her hobby, Honami is also a layman miko, and often tests her abilities against the numerous youkai that Keiji knows. She also seems to be overly enthusiastic about charms and trinkets with special powers. By her own admission, while she can easily get along with others, she has few real friends because of her interest in the occult."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c962"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫女のコスプレを好む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖怪好きで、お祓いの方法なども知っているが、妖怪を見ることはできない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「もっとこう！　情熱的に！　感情を爆発させようじゃないか！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18175","sourceWorkId":"10855","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫女の格好を好む。妖怪好きで、お祓いの方法なども知っているが、妖怪を見ることはできない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「もっとこう！　情熱的に！　感情を爆発させようじゃないか！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54731"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18175","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18175","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18175","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18175","sourceWorkId":"10855","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/931ae555772d2c895dc58a4021b50fddfa960b9c8b56fb34005d77dc4c1ddf5b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d379dc1a98a778788cc2be3f0ce14a223d64234daeff23073420f1489cd9d437.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"後藤麻衣","creatorId":"vndb:s469","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s469","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s469","name":"後藤 麻衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:13251:54731:4809:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c954","characterName":"五日市圭治","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c954"},"originalCharacterName":"五日市圭治","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A teenager that lives by himself in the town of Tokieda, with his closest living relative being his grandfather, an author and researcher of the paranormal. Our protagonist has the peculiar ability to recognize supernatural beings with ease as well as the ability to see ghosts and other entities not visible to normal humans. Due to a complicated set of circumstances, Keiji has a strong hatred for ghosts and phantoms (also known as youkai), blaming them for the problems in his life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Keiji's life has taken a bit of a downturn since the death of his parents, and he is generally seen as a loner that makes little effort to interact with others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c954"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9ca65f68bf61fb2c49dd1d0e44d110ed5a00fcf48bb58a0